1
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:03,050
(Stuart:)Yeah, I don't recall any offers.

2
00:00:04,784 --> 00:00:07,454
But, you know, uh, I-I'm glad
it worked out the way it did

3
00:00:07,453 --> 00:00:11,523
(Stuart:)because I got to know
this wonderful person.

4
00:00:11,524 --> 00:00:13,194
(Howard(on phone):)Yeah.

5
00:00:13,192 --> 00:00:15,092
(Raj:)Mrs. Wolowitz was
pretty special.

6
00:00:15,094 --> 00:00:17,424
(Raj:)When I first moved to America,

7
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:19,960
(Raj:)Howard was my only friend.

8
00:00:19,966 --> 00:00:23,196
(Raj:)She made me feel
so welcome in her home.

9
00:00:23,202 --> 00:00:26,202
(Raj:)Which says a lot,
because, those first few years,

10
00:00:26,205 --> 00:00:28,935
(Raj:)she thought I was the gardener.

11
00:00:30,009 --> 00:00:31,679
(Penny:)Whenever I saw her,

12
00:00:31,677 --> 00:00:34,677
(Penny:)she'd say I was too skinny
and try and feed me.

13
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:36,280
(chuckles)

14
00:00:36,282 --> 00:00:38,212
(Amy:)She did that to me, too.

15
00:00:38,217 --> 00:00:40,647
(Penny:)Don't take this away from me.

16
00:00:41,721 --> 00:00:44,221
(Sheldon:)I didn't care
for her yelling.

17
00:00:44,223 --> 00:00:47,223
(Sheldon:)But now that I'm not going
to hear it again,

18
00:00:47,226 --> 00:00:48,796
(Sheldon:)I'm sad.

19
00:00:48,794 --> 00:00:50,864
(Nathan Fillion:)If you want,
I can yell at you later.

20
00:00:53,633 --> 00:00:55,003
(Sheldon:)It won't be as good.

21
00:00:57,970 --> 00:00:59,440
(Leonard:)Let's have a toast.

22
00:01:01,474 --> 00:01:03,144
(Leonard:)To Mrs. Wolowitz.

23
00:01:03,142 --> 00:01:05,172
(Leonard:)A loving mother...

24
00:01:08,114 --> 00:01:10,114
(Leonard:)...to all of us.

25
00:01:10,116 --> 00:01:13,186
(Leonard:)We'll miss you.

